msgid "Selected provider assembly gate"
msgstr "选定提供者装配门禁"

msgid ""
"The maintained gate links explicitly authored software fixtures through "
"their existing CMake projects. TOML and the sole configuration resolver "
"select the exact part, Board package, backend, routes, modes and budgets. "
"The gate does not rewrite a backend, create a provider registry, select "
"source targets or infer physical Board wiring."
msgstr ""
"维护中的门禁通过既有 CMake 工程链接显式编写的软件夹具。TOML 与唯一配置解析器选择精确料号、Board "
"包、后端、路由、模式及预算。门禁不改写后端、不建立提供者注册表、不选择源码目标，也不推断物理 Board 接线。"

msgid ""
"Repeat `--fixture` for a reviewed list of authored TOMLs. Each file must be "
"in `tests/contracts`, have its maintained sibling `CMakeLists.txt`, and "
"resolve to an MCU configuration. The optional family assertion compares the "
"actual resolver result. Different backends require distinct maintained "
"authored TOMLs; there is no independent OS override in this gate. CMake "
"builds each fixture's default target graph using `NEXUS_SOURCE_ROOT` and "
"`NEXUS_ASSEMBLY_FILE`. The selected source root must be the checkout that "
"owns the executed gate and its imported tools; tools from a different source"
" checkout are refused."
msgstr ""
"重复 `--fixture` 指定已审阅 TOML 列表。各文件须位于 `tests/contracts`、有同目录维护的 "
"`CMakeLists.txt`，且解析为 MCU 配置。可选系列断言比较真实解析结果。不同后端必须使用不同的维护中 TOML；门禁没有独立 OS "
"覆盖。CMake 使用 `NEXUS_SOURCE_ROOT` 与 `NEXUS_ASSEMBLY_FILE` "
"构建各夹具默认目标图。所选源码根必须是执行门禁及其导入工具所属 checkout；拒绝其他源码 checkout 的工具。"

msgid ""
"The output directory must be absent. Existing evidence, symlink destinations"
" and source directories are refused. Every actual command records its argv, "
"working directory, timestamps, return code and original stdout/stderr bytes."
" Missing tools, nonzero exits, timeouts and background artifact writers fail"
" the matrix and preserve its failed report. An empty or duplicate matrix "
"cannot count as successful work."
msgstr ""
"输出目录必须不存在。既有证据、符号链接目标和源码目录均拒绝。每条真实命令记录 argv、工作目录、时间戳、返回码和原始 stdout/stderr "
"字节。缺失工具、非零退出、超时或后台产物写入者使矩阵失败并保留失败报告。空矩阵或重复矩阵不能算成功工作。"

msgid ""
"After each real build, the gate requires exactly one firmware ELF and one "
"completed generated bundle. It compares the built canonical configuration "
"digest against the original resolved authored input, rechecks every declared"
" input, and recomputes memory allocation using the existing ELF resource "
"tool. The original post-link report must match the recomputation. Flash LOAD"
" bytes, Flash footprint, each physical RAM domain, MSP and heap retain their"
" existing budget semantics."
msgstr ""
"每次真实构建后，门禁要求恰好一个固件 ELF 与一个完整生成包。它比较已构建的规范配置摘要与原始作者输入解析结果，复核全部声明输入，并使用既有 ELF "
"资源工具重新计算内存分配。原始链接后报告须与重算相符。Flash LOAD 字节、Flash 占用、各物理 RAM 域、MSP 和 heap "
"保持既有预算语义。"

msgid ""
"For selected I/O, the existing retention tool independently follows actual "
"face pointers, concrete operations tables and every non-NULL method in ELF "
"LOAD bytes. Its post-link report must match the recomputation. A "
"deliberately empty fixture instead proves zero authored controllers/devices,"
" zero generated face declarations and absence of concrete I/O provider "
"tables and faces from the actual ELF. This is an executed empty-selection GC"
" check, not a skipped retention check or a claim that all unrelated runtime "
"code is absent."
msgstr ""
"选定 I/O 的既有保留检查工具独立追踪实际接口面指针、具体方法表及 ELF LOAD 中每个非 NULL "
"方法。链接后报告须与重算相符。刻意为空的夹具则证明零作者控制器／器件、零生成接口声明，且真实 ELF 不含具体 I/O "
"提供者表与接口面。这是实际执行的空选择 GC 检查，不是跳过保留检查，也不声称所有无关运行时代码都不存在。"

msgid ""
"The actual compiler database and Ninja dependency log bind compiled sources,"
" generated headers, selected vendor headers and compiler-provided headers to"
" file identities. Maintained graph/configuration sources and selected locked"
" SDK input bytes are snapshotted before execution and verified afterward. "
"The matrix rejects source, Git revision, tool or artifact changes. A dirty "
"checkout may provide explicitly identified development evidence; it cannot "
"qualify a clean release candidate through this gate alone."
msgstr ""
"真实编译数据库与 Ninja 依赖日志把编译源码、生成头文件、所选厂商头文件和编译器头文件绑定至文件身份。维护的图／配置源码及所选锁定 SDK "
"输入字节在执行前快照，执行后复核。矩阵拒绝源码、Git revision、工具或产物变更。脏 checkout "
"可以提供显式标识的开发证据，但不能仅凭此门禁取得 clean 发布候选资格。"

msgid ""
"`report.json` records `selected_provider_assembly_matrix`, actual fixture "
"and command counts, source identities, tool identities, per-fixture "
"configuration digests, ELF/BIN/map/bundle/report identities, RAM domains and"
" retained methods. All successful fixtures must pass; there is no skipped-"
"pass result. CI owns its explicit fixture list and uploads original commands"
" and artifacts alongside the report."
msgstr ""
"`report.json` 记录 "
"`selected_provider_assembly_matrix`、真实夹具／命令数量、源码身份、工具身份、各夹具配置摘要、ELF/BIN/map/bundle/report"
" 身份、RAM 域和保留方法。全部成功夹具均须通过，没有跳过即通过的结果。CI 持有显式夹具列表，并与报告一同上传原始命令及产物。"

msgid ""
"This gate establishes software graph, compile/link, budget and selected "
"provider retention evidence. It does not execute MCU startup, interrupts, "
"DMA, USB enumeration, Ethernet traffic, timer waveforms or electrical "
"controls. Physical status remains `not_executed`; cycles and latency remain "
"`not_measured`. Model tests and eventual HIL qualification are separate "
"scopes."
msgstr ""
"本门禁建立软件图、编译／链接、预算及所选提供者保留证据，不执行 MCU 启动、中断、DMA、USB 枚举、Ethernet 流量、timer "
"波形或电气控制。物理状态保持 `not_executed`，周期和延迟保持 `not_measured`。模型测试与后续 HIL 资格范围独立。"

msgid "Tool regression tests run with:"
msgstr "工具回归测试命令："
